><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">On 2026-06-29, a virtual machine in the Azure Managed Redis cluster amr-az01-prd-iamui-01 experienced degradation and eventual failure due to a problem with the underlying host machine. During this period, Redis cluster control-plane communications became unstable, and the system detected a loss of quorum safety. To protect data consistency, the platform entered automated quorum-loss recovery behavior, which resulted in total data loss as well as downtime until recovery completed.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Updated issue timeline</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"></span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">2026-06-29 UTC</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">05:23-05:29 : One cluster virtual machine began experiencing instability with intermittent drops in traffic due to failure of a network component on the host machine. This unhealthy VM was initially the cluster leader.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">05:29-05:52 : The unhealthy VM experienced further degradation due to the network component failure. New connection attempts failed and packet losses occurred; however, some remaining network communication was ongoing.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">05:29–05:31 : The remaining healthy cluster virtual machine experienced cluster quorum health-check failures caused by lack of communication to a cluster leader.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">05:31 : Due to continuous quorum health check failures for 100s, automation detected a quorum-loss condition was and automated recovery actions were triggered to maintain a consistent cluster state, which resulted in downtime and data loss.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">05:53 : Via automated recovery, the unhealthy VM was moved from the unhealthy host onto a different healthy host.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">05:56 : Both virtual machines were fully online, and the Redis cluster was recreated, restoring availability.</span></p></div><div style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; margin-bottom:3.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; margin-bottom:3.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">1. HA </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">구성에서의</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> Quorum Loss </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">발생</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">사유</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">(Root Cause)</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"></span></p></div><div style=\"margin-top:1.0pt; margin-bottom:1.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">하나의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> VM </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">장애가</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">어떻게</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">나머지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> VM</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">의</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">쿼럼</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">헬스체크</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">실패</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">및</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">전체</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">클러스터</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">쿼럼</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">상실로</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">이어졌는지</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">상세한</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">메커니즘</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">설명</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">.</span></p></div><div style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; margin-bottom:3.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow\">[</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black; background:yellow\">답</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow\">]</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"></span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Between 05:29-05:31, the remaining healthy cluster virtual machine should have triggered a new leader election and elected itself as leader. However, due to a defect in Redis Enterprise clustering logic, the healthy virtual machine did not elect itself as leader within the time it takes for automated cluster quorum health checks to trigger a loss of cluster quorum.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Normally, caches with high availability that experience unavailability of one VM will detect that the lost VM died and trigger a re-election. A healthy VM will become cluster leader, and replica Redis shards for the primaries on the unavailable VM will promote to primary shards to retain data and maintain availability.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">The difference with this scenario compared to typical high availability recovery was in the failure mode on the host machine. There was an extended period of time of partial communication from the unhealthy VM rather than the typical case total unavailability, and it is this extended partial communication that triggered the bug in clustering logic.</span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; margin-bottom:3.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">2. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">장시간의</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">자동</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:black\">복구소요</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; color:b